        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Called many times, never received a call back. Our real estate agent was able to resolve this problem, all is well now. Very nice people to deal with.\n\n***UPDATE (April 21  2021)*** Working with the contractor now for a new home. Very early in the process. So far, so good. Our rep J-L, answers our calls right away, and if not, responds fairly quick. Very punctual on email responses. Will provide further updates as work progresses.",
